{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19167","headline":"福先寺雪中酬别乐天 · 刘禹锡","name":"福先寺雪中酬别乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙门宾客会龙宫，东去旌旗驻上东。\n二八笙歌云幕下，三千世界雪花中。\n离堂未暗排红烛，别曲含凄扬晚风。\n才子从今一分散，便将诗咏向吴侬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}